      L hA 𝔭 (g₁ * r₁) hr C₁ hfin₁ 𝓛₁ h𝓛₁ C₀ ρ₀ hρ₀₁ hρ₀₂ L₀ hL₀ hKT₀
  refine ⟨r₁ * g, fun h => (Ideal.IsPrime.mem_or_mem inferInstance h).elim hr₁ hg, Dvd.intro g rfl, ?_⟩
